# Immutable package artifacts are verified byte-for-byte: a manifest pins the
# SHA-256 and byte length of every file beside it, and the registry index pins
# the SHA-256 of the manifest itself.
#
# Line-ending translation therefore breaks them. With core.autocrlf=true, git
# rewrites LF to CRLF on checkout, which changes both the length and the hash
# of every JSON file here — so a fresh clone (a release build's clone included)
# would produce a package that fails its own integrity check and silently falls
# back to default icons.
#
# -text disables all end-of-line conversion for this tree. Nothing under
# Public_Content is hand-edited prose; it is generated, hashed output.
Public_Content/** -text
